        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to understand the realities of modern international geopolitics?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover not only what hot wars are, but also information wars—using a wide arsenal of tools to strengthen your nation and increase pressure on your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a president or a hidden power player, approving actions and responding to sudden crises as if it were real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GLOBAL CONTROL COUNTRIES – a strategic card simulator and a mini-encyclopedia of international statecraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in 37 languages. A blend of thrilling gameplay and real educational impact with a unique game mechanic. Don’t be afraid of complexity—the game feels closer to Blackjack than to Poker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative card combat system unlike anything you’ve seen before</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 game modes + 1 bonus mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >63 objects, 60 situations, 12 global events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >135 cards in total, with 9 subtypes in various combinations for unique gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power principle: victory through point accumulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 dynamic parameters – attack &amp; defense, rising or falling in each battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk &amp; reward: not only collecting cards, but also losing them depending on battle outcomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Education audit – influences battle parameters and enhances the player’s strategic knowledge for both in-game and real-world application</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coalition struggles on an interactive world map for global dominance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret codes unlocked after victories to open a special unlimited bonus mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GLOBAL CONTROL COUNTRIES – a game that teaches, entertains, and reveals the inner workings of world geopolitics!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080230/extras/9a347db53a980fbf18dccd272c094744.avif?t=1762817349\" alt=\"Coalition battle\" width=1560 height=912 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080230/extras/8093ab842b3db00352b18774bd771268.avif?t=1762817349\" alt=\"Simple battle\" width=1560 height=916 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080230/extras/52722522ee2c13d74a8252de720ca551.avif?t=1762817349\" alt=\"Objects\" width=1560 height=911 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080230/extras/747854073a0a0ead1850ebd80ca8dd2b.avif?t=1762817349\" alt=\"Events\" width=1560 height=908 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080230/extras/9b10ae064d05f72ba624aba50f88c135.avif?t=1762817349\" alt=\"Situations\" width=1560 height=908 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080230/extras/882ff508f79bb48fea67eeae017b1678.avif?t=1762817349\" alt=\"Object attacking\" width=1064 height=719 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080230/extras/075ad8cb19e79db015029d6a4e6c605b.avif?t=1762817349\" alt=\"Codes collection\" width=1399 height=867 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080230/extras/26af5c829bcc06425a238666c46bc650.avif?t=1762817349\" alt=\"MIssion\" width=1560 height=908 /></span><span 