        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to understand the realities of modern international geopolitics?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover not only what hot wars are, but also information wars—using a wide arsenal of tools to strengthen your nation and increase pressure on your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a president or a hidden power player, approving actions and responding to sudden crises as if it were real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GLOBAL CONTROL COUNTRIES – a strategic card simulator and a mini-encyclopedia of international statecraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in 37 languages. A blend of thrilling gameplay and real educational impact with a unique game mechanic. Don’t be afraid of complexity—the game feels closer to Blackjack than to Poker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative card combat system unlike anything you’ve seen before</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 game modes + 1 bonus mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >63 objects, 60 situations, 12 global events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >135 cards in total, with 9 subtypes in various combinations for unique gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power principle: victory through point accumulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 dynamic parameters – attack &amp; defense, rising or falling in each battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk &amp; reward: not only collecting cards, but also losing them depending on battle outcomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Education audit – influences battle parameters and enhances the player’s strategic knowledge for both in-game and real-world application</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coalition struggles on an interactive world map for global dominance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret codes unlocked after victories to open a special unlimited bonus mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GLOBAL CONTROL COUNTRIES – a game that teaches, entertains, and